The async test uses [[#[tokio::test]]] to run within a Tokio runtime, allowing
us to actually exercise the shutdown logic. We use an invalid tracker URL to
verify the best-effort behavior: even when notification fails, the exit code
is 0 because the shutdown itself was successful.
